---

# ✨ Key Features

- ✅ Highly available multi-AZ architecture
- ✅ EC2 instances deployed in private subnets
- ✅ Internet-facing Application Load Balancer
- ✅ Application health checks
- ✅ Auto Scaling Group
- ✅ CPU-based target tracking
- ✅ Automatic replacement of unhealthy instances
- ✅ NAT Gateway for private subnet outbound connectivity
- ✅ Security Group based access control
- ✅ Automated Nginx installation
- ✅ Automated static website deployment
- ✅ Infrastructure provisioned completely using Terraform
- ✅ AWS Systems Manager access without an EC2 key pair
- ✅ Infrastructure separated into reusable Terraform configuration files

